q BT 31.18 572.32 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 2.853 Tw (This policy establishes the information security framework for [Organisation Name]. It defines the principles, responsibilities, and minimum) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 559.57 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (requirements for protecting the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of information assets.) Tj ET Q
BT /F1 10.00 Tf ET
q 28.35 538.58 538.59 -19.84 re f BT 31.18 525.66 Td 1 1 1 rg (  2. SCOPE) Tj ET Q
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 504.29 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.113 Tw (This policy applies to all employees, contractors, consultants, and third-party personnel who access, process, or manage information assets belonging) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 491.54 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 1.297 Tw (to [Organisation Name]. It covers all information systems, networks, applications, physical locations, and data processing activities, regardless of) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 478.78 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (location or ownership.) Tj ET Q
BT /F1 10.00 Tf ET
q 28.35 457.80 538.59 -19.84 re f BT 31.18 444.87 Td 1 1 1 rg (  3. POLICY STATEMENTS) Tj ET Q
BT /F1 9.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 421.08 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (3.1  Access Control) Tj ET Q
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 406.50 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 1.021 Tw (Access to information systems and data shall be granted on a least-privilege basis. User access requests must be authorised by the data owner.) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 393.74 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.730 Tw (Privileged access requires separate approval and quarterly recertification. Multi-factor authentication is mandatory for remote access, administrative) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 380.99 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (accounts, and any system containing sensitive data.) Tj ET Q
BT /F1 9.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 360.13 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (3.2  Data Handling & Classification) Tj ET Q
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 345.55 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.214 Tw (All data shall be classified as Public, Internal, Confidential, or Restricted. Handling requirements -- including encryption at rest and in transit, data loss) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 332.80 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 1.229 Tw (prevention, retention schedules, and secure disposal -- correspond to classification level. Confidential and Restricted data must not be stored on) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 320.04 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (personal devices without authorised encryption software.) Tj ET Q
BT /F1 9.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 299.19 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (3.3  Incident Reporting) Tj ET Q
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 284.61 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 1.263 Tw (All security incidents, suspected breaches, and anomalous events must be reported to the Security Operations team within [1 hour / 4 hours] of) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 271.85 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.507 Tw (discovery. Reports must include: date/time of discovery, description of the event, systems affected, and immediate actions taken. Retaliation against) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 259.10 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (good-faith reporters is strictly prohibited.) Tj ET Q
BT /F1 9.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 238.25 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (3.4  Password Policy) Tj ET Q
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 223.66 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.597 Tw (Passwords must be a minimum of 12 characters and should not be reused across organisational accounts. Passphrases are encouraged. Accounts) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 210.91 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.279 Tw (are locked after 5 failed attempts. Password managers are mandatory for all personnel. Shared credentials are prohibited; service accounts must use) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 198.15 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (certificate or token-based authentication where possible.) Tj ET Q
BT /F1 9.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 177.30 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (3.5  Remote Work & Mobile Security) Tj ET Q
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 162.72 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.280 Tw (Remote access must be established via VPN with multi-factor authentication. Personal devices used for work must have disk encryption, screen lock,) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 149.96 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.091 Tw (and approved endpoint protection installed. Company data may not be stored on unmanaged devices. Public Wi-Fi must only be used with VPN active) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 137.21 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (and HTTPS enforced.) Tj ET Q
BT /F1 10.00 Tf ET
q 28.35 116.22 538.59 -19.84 re f BT 31.18 103.30 Td 1 1 1 rg (  4. ENFORCEMENT & COMPLIANCE) Tj ET Q
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 81.93 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg 0.691 Tw (Compliance with this policy is mandatory. Violations may result in disciplinary action, up to and including termination of employment or legal action.) Tj ET Q
